      "contextFingerprint": "5cd47e2531177786367e5255032a82e07e235459eb641111d92b4127c301b88b",
      "sourceText": "| 智能指针 | 所有权含义 | 典型场景 |\n|:---|:---|:---|\n| `std::unique_ptr<T>` | 独占所有权 | 默认选择，一个对象只有一个拥有者 |\n| `std::shared_ptr<T>` | 共享所有权 | 对象确实需要多个拥有者共同延长生命周期 |\n| `std::weak_ptr<T>` | 弱引用，不拥有 | 观察 `shared_ptr` 管理的对象，常用于打破循环引用 |",
      "translatedText": "| Smart pointers | Ownership semantics | Typical scenarios |\n|:---|:---|:---|\n| `std::unique_ptr<T>` | Exclusive ownership | Default choice; an object has only one owner |\n| `std::shared_ptr<T>` | Shared ownership | The object genuinely needs multiple owners to jointly extend its lifetime |\n| `std::weak_ptr<T>` | Weak reference, non\\-owning | Observe the object managed by `shared_ptr`, commonly used to break cyclic references |",
      "provider": "deepseek",
      "model": "deepseek-flash",
      "usage": {
        "inputTokens": 179,
        "outputTokens": 69,
        "costUsd": 0.000137
      }
